# 🚀 Vendor Routes Deployment Package

## 📁 Files to Deploy to Live Server

### 1. vendorNotifications.js
**Location**: Copy to `/routes/` directory
**Purpose**: Adds vendor notifications API endpoints
**Routes Added**:
- `GET /api/vendor-notifications` - Get all notifications
- `PUT /api/vendor-notifications/:id/read` - Mark notification as read
- `PUT /api/vendor-notifications/mark-all-read` - Mark all notifications as read
- `DELETE /api/vendor-notifications/:id` - Delete notification

### 2. vendorAuth.js (Update)
**Location**: Replace existing `/routes/vendorAuth.js`
**Purpose**: Adds vendor login route
**Routes Added**:
- `POST /api/vendor/auth/login` - Vendor authentication

### 3. server.js (Update)
**Location**: Replace existing `server.js`
**Purpose**: Register vendor notifications route
**Changes Required**:
Add this line to routes section (around line 249):
```javascript
app.use("/api/vendor-notifications", require("./routes/vendorNotifications"));
```

## 🔧 Deployment Steps

1. **Backup existing files** on live server
2. **Copy vendorNotifications.js** to `/routes/` directory
3. **Replace vendorAuth.js** with updated version
4. **Update server.js** to include the new route
5. **Restart server** to apply changes

